  "intentionalBoundaries": [
    "Source ENV, authentication, subscription scope and private output remain Coke host responsibilities.",
    "Refresh runs source init but returns acknowledgement instead of exposing the original rule/config object.",
    "Python IPC uses JSON, not legacy pickle. PHP errors are redacted and TLS is verified by default.",
    "DR2 is distributed as client type3 with the original runtime; legacy server drpyS fallback is not a separate original DR2 API.",
    "Original XBPQ empty test.json fails rule.init; the placeholder is retained but not advertised as an executable source engine.",
    "Reference container interpreter versions can differ; the gate checks script behavior, not arbitrary operating-system APIs."
  ],
